      <VERS vnumber="6"> The <gr str="7272">foot </gr>shall tread it <gr str="7429">down</gr>, <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> even </STYLE> the <gr str="7272">feet </gr>of the <gr str="6041">poor</gr>, <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> and </STYLE> the <gr str="6471">steps </gr>of the <gr str="1800">needy</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="7"> The <gr str="734">way </gr>of the <gr str="6662">just </gr>
        <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> is </STYLE>
        <gr str="4339">uprightness</gr>: thou, most <gr str="3477">upright</gr>, dost <gr str="6424">weigh </gr>the <gr str="4570">path </gr>of the <gr str="6662">just</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="8">
        <gr str="637">Yea</gr>, in the <gr str="734">way </gr>of thy <gr str="4941">judgments</gr>, O <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, have we <gr str="6960">waited </gr>for thee; the <gr str="8378">desire </gr>of <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> our </STYLE>
        <gr str="5315">soul </gr>
