        <gr str="6664">righteousness</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="10"> Let favor be <gr str="2603">showed </gr>to the <gr str="7563">wicked</gr>, <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> yet </STYLE> will he <gr str="1077">not </gr>
