        <gr str="2372">see</gr>: <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> but </STYLE> they shall <gr str="2372">see</gr>, and be <gr str="954">ashamed </gr>for <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> their </STYLE>
        <gr str="7068">envy </gr>at the <gr str="5971">people</gr>; <gr str="637">yea</gr>, the <gr str="784">fire </gr>of thine <gr str="6862">enemies </gr>shall <gr str="398">devour </gr>them. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="12">
        <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, thou wilt <gr str="8239">ordain </gr>
