        <gr str="6965">rise</gr>: <gr str="3651">therefore </gr>hast thou <gr str="6485">visited </gr>and <gr str="8045">destroyed </gr>them, and made <gr str="3605">all </gr>their <gr str="2143">memory </gr>to <gr str="6">perish</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="15"> Thou hast <gr str="3254">increased </gr>the <gr str="1471">nation</gr>, O <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>, thou hast <gr str="3254">increased </gr>the <gr str="1471">nation</gr>: thou art <gr str="3513">glorified</gr>: thou hadst removed <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> it </STYLE>
