      <VERS vnumber="17"> Like <gr str="3644">as </gr>a woman with <gr str="2030">child</gr>, <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> that </STYLE> draweth <gr str="7126">near </gr>the time of her <gr str="3205">delivery</gr>, is in <gr str="2342">pain</gr>, <STYLE css="color:#808080;font-style:italic"> and </STYLE> crieth <gr str="2199">out </gr>in her <gr str="2256">pangs</gr>; <gr str="3651">so </gr>have we <gr str="1961">been </gr>in thy <gr str="4480 6440">sight</gr>, O <gr str="3068">LORD</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="18"> We have been with <gr str="2029">child</gr>, we have been in <gr str="2342">pain</gr>, we have as it <gr str="3644">were </gr>brought <gr str="3205">forth </gr>
